# Projection charts

Assets and cash-flow charts keep their Recharts structure, modes, and series
toggles. Redesigns may remap series colors and chrome only.

## Idle last-point tooltip

On `lg+`, the tooltip stays on the final year when the pointer is outside
the chart (`defaultIndex` + remount on mouse leave). Below `lg` there is no
hover, so do not auto-open that last point: the tooltip covers the plot.
It still opens when the user taps a year.
